  <Place Angle="0" AngularSize="0" Constellation="FOR" DataSetType="Sky" Dec="-27.8221452460338" Magnitude="0" Name="JWST Advanced Deep Extragalactic Survey (JADES)" Opacity="100" RA="3.541738047433047" Rotation="0" Thumbnail="https://data1.wwtassets.org/packages/2022/12_jwst/jades/thumb.jpg" ZoomLevel="2.506868958509465">
    <Description>This near-infrared image from the NASA/ESA/CSA James Webb Space Telescope shows a region of the sky in and around the Hubble Space Telescope's Ultra Deep Field, observed as part of the JWST Advanced Deep Extragalactic Survey (JADES). JADES is an ambitious program, allocated just over one month of telescope time spread over two years, designed to provide a view of the early Universe unprecedented in both depth and detail, and is an international collaboration of more than eighty astronomers from ten countries. The program began with Webb's Near-Infrared Camera (NIRCam), using over 10 days of mission time to observe the field in nine different infrared colours. The region is 15 times larger than the deepest infrared images produced by the Hubble Space Telescope, yet is even deeper and sharper at these wavelengths — only the size a human appears when viewed from a mile away, yet teeming with nearly 100,000 galaxies, each caught at some moment in their history, billions of years in the past. Using the NIRSpec instrument, astronomers confirmed some of the earliest galaxies ever observed, including four at redshifts above 10. The light from these galaxies has taken more than 13.4 billion years to reach us, as they date back to less than 400 million years after the big bang, when the Universe was only 2% of its current age.</Description>
    <ForegroundImageSet>
      <ImageSet BandPass="Visible" BaseDegreesPerTile="0.34147894398511347" BaseTileLevel="0" BottomsUp="False" CenterX="53.1260707114957" CenterY="-27.8221452460338" DataSetType="Sky" ElevationModel="False" FileType=".png" Generic="False" Name="JWST Advanced Deep Extragalactic Survey (JADES)" Projection="Tan" QuadTreeMap="" Rotation="0.027922751406999242" Sparse="False" StockSet="False" TileLevels="4" Url="https://data1.wwtassets.org/packages/2022/12_jwst/jades/{1}/{3}/{3}_{2}.png" WidthFactor="2" Xastropix_ids="stsci|2023-127a" Xcxstatus="in:642761de975014bc743f158d">
